  "details": "I know I'm just a random but I know a lot about how App Store publishing works. that said Apple Silicon Macs can run the iPad version of the game natively, its just a few clicks to allow the iPad version to be downloaded on a Mac and boom, you added support for a entire platform in just a few clicks. ill link how. \n\nhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/apple-silicon/running-your-ios-apps-in-macos\n\nhttps://developer.apple.com/fr/videos/play/wwdc2020/10114/\n\nI really hope to one day see that VRChat gets macOS support.",
